  "description": "The rigorously-designed Sport gives you the ultimate freedom to tackle tough terrain, hilly streets and everything in between.\nTake your adventures up a notch with more speed, power, and all-terrain capability than ever. The Bluejay Sport gives you the ultimate freedom to explore—on gravel, dirt, or hilly city streets. (Think of it as the SUV of e-bikes.)\nNavigate rugged terrain with WTB/Nano cross-country tires; reach speeds of up to 28MPH with a 500W mid-drive motor and 5 levels of pedal assist; charge up any hill with powerful 120m torque and a 10-speed Shimano gear hub, and trek for up to 75 miles on a single charge with a 620 W/H, 48V battery.\nWhether you’re hitting a trail or leading a family ride, the Bluejay Sport will make the journey a lot more fun—with Bluejay’s signature mix of best-in-class technology and elevated design.",
